//! tr kodlu 3 dil=en
// Error 03 — Unterminated text.
// Message code: H0010
// What happens: The program does not run at all; the message says that the opened double quote was never closed.
// Why: A string literal opened by a " needs a closing ".
// Fixed version:
//     print("hello")
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/03_syntax_unterminated_text.tr   (exit code 1)

TR_fn_print("hello)
